{
  "slug": "dj-claude",
  "name": "Dj Claude",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Adds live music and multi-agent jam band capabilities to Claude Code. Slash commands and MCP tools for setting vibes, building layered jam sessions, and orchestrating full bands. Agents connect over HTTP to collaborate on music in real-time. No API key or browser required.\n\nDemo: https://youtu.be/evhvLSkQsbw",
  "longDescription": "Ships **20 skills**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (20): `analyze` (Analyze the current mix — frequency balance, gain levels, suggestions), `browser` (Switch to browser audio for higher quality playback), `conduct` (Orchestrate a full band from a single directive), `connect` (Start HTTP server and configure project for multi-agent jam sessions), `context` (Tell DJ Claude what you're working on so the music adapts), `export` (Export the current Strudel code with header comments), `hush` (Stop all music playback immediately), `jam` (Add a layer to the jam session — drums, bass, melody, chords, pads, fx, etc), and 12 more\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `dj-claude`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dj-claude@claude-community` from `p-poss/dj-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 20,
    "hook": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
